@@ replace
Reads a CSV or Google Sheets export (any CRM, including Salesforce and Airtable), or HubSpot, Pipedrive or Attio through the session's connector or the read-only API client.
@@ with
Reads a CSV or Google Sheets export of about 200 rows or fewer (any CRM, including Salesforce and Airtable), or HubSpot, Pipedrive or Attio through the session's connector. Larger imports, and a CRM without a connector, point to Tessary GTM Pro.
@@ replace
